From: Warcraft Recorder contributors
Subject: Run recording hooks inside the application sandbox

The upstream Flatpak build delegates every hook through `flatpak-spawn
--host`. Warcraft Recorder installs and owns its hook inside the sandbox, so
host command execution is unnecessary and would require a broad permission.

--- a/src/main.cpp
+++ b/src/main.cpp
@@ -911,23 +911,11 @@ static void run_recording_saved_script_async(const char *script_file, const cha
         return;
     }
